<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins firm; butts unevenly steady; skinned hams steady to $1.00 higher; seedless bellies 12-14 lbs. 1.00 higher in a light test; lean trimmings steady to weak.</p>
